# Bennett Furina Xiangling Citlali. ~20s Rot. Citlali Furinational with Bennett funneling Xiangling's burst, then on-field skill spam after Citlali skill+burst. DPS weapons on Citlali lead to higher team DPS. -3K DPS with freeze immuninity.

# Team - Options listed by DPS
bennett char lvl=90/90 cons=6 talent=9,9,9;
